Also compliance_certificate_available compliance_certificate_alpha is already true initially; must remain true at goal (cannot be consumed? Some actions may remove compliance_certificate_available via assign_compliance_certificate (effect not compliance_certificate_available). So we must avoid consuming it unless we later re-add via release_compliance_certificate. Since goal wants it available, we should not assign it (or if we assign we must release). Similarly route_task_profile_available route_task_profile_alpha initially true; some actions like attach_task_profile or allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate consume route_task_profile_available (by linking and making it not available). So must avoid consuming it unless we later release/detach. Goal wants it available.

