Thus we need to create shift_candidate_beta (create_candidate). Also need to dispatch shift_candidate_alpha and origin_availability_alpha.

To dispatch a candidate (schedule_candidate) we need execute_schedule_dispatch with parameters ?candidate - schedule_candidate ?vehicle_unit - vehicle_unit ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot.

Preconditions:
(dispatch_allocated ?candidate)
(candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit)
(candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot)
(not (dispatched ?candidate))

Effect: (dispatched ?candidate) (vehicle_available ?vehicle_unit) (dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot)

Thus before dispatch we need to allocate dispatch slot for candidate, link vehicle, etc.

Similarly for origin_availability_alpha (which is an origin_candidate_availability). There's execute_origin_dispatch action with same pattern but parameters ?origin_availability - origin_candidate_availability ?vehicle_unit - vehicle_unit ?dispatch_slot - dispatch_slot.

Preconditions: (dispatch_allocated ?origin_availability) (candidate_vehicle_linked ?origin_availability ?vehicle_unit) (candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?origin_availability ?dispatch_slot) (not (dispatched ?origin_availability))

Effect similar.

Thus we need to make dispatch_allocated true for shift_candidate_alpha and origin_availability_alpha, link vehicle and dispatch slot.

Dispatch allocated is done via allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate action (for candidate_entity). It requires dispatch_ready ?candidate, candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile, dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_allocated ?candidate. Effect: dispatch_allocated ?candidate, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot, not dispatch_slot_available ?dispatch_slot.

Thus we need dispatch_ready true, candidate_task_profile_linked true, and a dispatch slot available.

Dispatch_ready for schedule_candidate is set via finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation or finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation or finalize_candidate_direct (these add dispatch_ready). Also there are mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready for origin/destination availabilities.

Thus for shift_candidate_alpha (schedule_candidate) we need to make it dispatch_ready. Could do finalize_candidate_after_compliance_validation (requires compliance_validation_complete ?candidate). Or finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation (requires candidate_clearance_established ?candidate and route_sequence_validated ?candidate). Or finalize_candidate_direct (requires candidate_clearance_established ?candidate and not route_sequence_context_set ?candidate and not candidate_finalized ?candidate). Probably simplest: finalize_candidate_direct after establishing clearance and not setting route_sequence_context_set.

Thus we need candidate_clearance_established for shift_candidate_alpha. Establish clearance via one of the establish_clearance_* actions. They require candidate_loading_verified ?candidate, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked ?candidate ?compliance_certificate, candidate_loading_container_linked ?candidate ?loading_container, loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg, plus conditions on origin_leg_loaded/destination_leg_loaded etc.

Simplest: establish_clearance_nominal (requires candidate_loading_verified, candidate_compliance_certificate_linked, candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_clearance_established). Effect: candidate_clearance_established ?candidate (no route_sequence_context_set). Actually effect only candidate_clearance_established (no route_sequence_context_set). Wait: establish_clearance_nominal effect: (candidate_clearance_established ?candidate). No route_sequence_context_set.

Thus we can use establish_clearance_nominal to get clearance, then finalize_candidate_direct (requires candidate_clearance_established, not route_sequence_context_set, not candidate_finalized). Since we haven't set route_sequence_context_set, that's satisfied. Then finalize_candidate_direct adds candidate_finalized and dispatch_ready.

